%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3122bbbb0e1cda246864273b9714d926, type: 3}
  m_Name: LevelsScriptable
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Levels:
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: e7097122e24de2c428e004b11709a5ac
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    Title: World World
    Description: Everything must lead to a new world.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 0000000007000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: '''Hounds'' have greatly increased HP and ATK.'
    SecretDes: The comrade woke me up, and when I opened my eyes, before me was a
      distant place, the middle of a forest.\n\nWe tried to process what had happened,
      but nothing really came to mind...
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: f4c9e32659abe90419b048428e30a2a2
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    Title: Compass
    Description: Is there a compass of passion in your heart?\nThe needle shakes,
      spinning round and round.\nIt points toward the future.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 070000000600000002000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 00000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: Terrains and enemies will differ in places, and more enemies
      will appear.
    SecretDes: Everything had been a mess earlier - the smoke of the battlefield,
      the clashing of swords, the sound of Arts being channeled, and people falling
      one after another...\n\nThen, an Originium bomb exploded right next to me.\n\nI
      think that was when I was knocked unconscious. I thought I was a goner...
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 46531bf0c44455e48a917bd76f67c89b
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    Title: No. 9
    Description: '"Mr. Patriot.\nStop making people cry.\nThese brimming eyes can
      no longer see."'
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 000000000700000005000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: Bloodboil Knightclub Elite's ability stacks twice as fast.
      All enemies have increased MSPD.
    SecretDes: Now here we are.\n\nMe and my comrade, only two of us, suddenly appear
      in this forest, surrounded by trees and dead silence. We still held on to our
      weapons, overwhelmed by pure confusion.
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: eee8edade3d19f140a922c70788f2803
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Survivor's March
    Description: 'She wipes the dust off the old stone, engraved on it are words
      from an era that has long gone:\n"Is just not my gote." '
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 0200000004000000030000000100000005000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: One Sentinel has their position changed and takes different
      route. All 'Sentinels' have increased MSPD.
    SecretDes: 'Suddenly, a tear streamed down my face.\n\nI will never understand
      what kind of feeling it was: sadness, panic, or relief.'
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 93e86f3bb47d4094991140c0a33d3c2d
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Rolling Stone
    Description: Have no love, no future either.\nHave no heart, no sadness either.\nGot
      no home to return to, wandering aimlessly.\nLike a rolling stone, how does
      that feel?
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 060000000200000005000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 03000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: '''Sentinel''''s alarm grants greatly increased ATK and
      MSPD. Enemies have their weights increased by 1.'
    SecretDes: We had been certain of our deaths. It had been engraved in our minds
      ever since we stepped onto the battlefield.\n\nIf this really is the afterlife,
      then so be it.\n\nMaybe I even feel a little happy that I still get to see
      this beauty one more time, even if this is the last.
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 7977e69d7cf749e44bbd543533c32746
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Crimson Dusk
    Description: '"But, if I give in and shut tight my eyes, how will I ever get
      to see the sunset ever again?"'
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 0400000003000000010000000a00000009000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 0100000000000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: All enemies become immune to physical and magical damage.
      'Originiutants' have increased ASPD.
    SecretDes: Except that, maybe this isn't the afterlife.\n\nEverything still feels
      so real, our senses work perfectly.\n\nWe try to kick, swing the weapon and
      cast Arts, all are normal.
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 280145a59ff2a6e4e8e179082d60ca0d
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Art Class
    Description: There are many ways to fill up a blank canvas. Regardless of what
      you choose, as long as you do with with your own hands, passion, and creativity,
      it's all beautiful and admirable.
    AddOn: <color=yellow>Swap cool-down is halved in this level.</color>
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 090000000b0000000c000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 01000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: Terrain and enemies will differ in places.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 9c829ef5b7f63734ebe46ccb124260f1
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Loop&Loop
    Description: Reality. Present. Day and night. And even time. I will run through
      them all.
    AddOn: <color=yellow>Your units have increased MSPD in this level.</color>\n<color=red>The
      'Sudarim' are immune to damage from Originium Pollutions.</color>
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 0200000003000000010000000a000000090000000c000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 000000000100000003000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: More 'Caustic Originium Spiders' will appear. One 'Sudaram'
      has different starting position.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 64a831af6d6b3ed478a5d905ae6d2fde
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: De Arriba
    Description: Just burn them all down if you want.\nFrom above, you woudn't take
      any damage anyway.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 050000000a000000090000000b0000000c000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 01000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: utants' will be replaced by 'Bloodboil Knightclub Elites'.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 25d55073365bba546bf074bc5649ea87
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Light
    Description: Hold tight to the days we spent together,\nNever let them go.
    AddOn: '<color=#00FFD0>Mint Fumo: Grants [INVENTIO] ''Victory Rewind - Spirit''
      and ''Victory Rewind - Excitement'' (ignores mutually exclusive).</color>\n\n<color=yellow>Swap
      cool-down reduces. And your units have greatly increased attributes.</color>'
    StageCompleteCondition: 3
    AppearingEnemies: 000000000700000006000000040000000300000001000000050000000a000000090000000b0000000c000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 0100000004000000
    BanSkills: 1a00000019000000
    ChallengeModeModifier: Enemies will try to steal the Mint Fumo instead.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: a030743e38a074747bed2154188883a1
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Prisoner in a Frame
    Description: Won't you set him free?
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 0c0000000d000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 0100000004000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: When 'Shrouded Assassin''s [Toward Death] is triggered,
      additional enemies will appear.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: a7895f7119506444ea1f9301e70fefe8
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: After Dark
    Description: The picture of such a day,\nIn words, I write them down and send
      to you.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 02000000010000000e0000000f000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 050000000000000002000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: '''Gloompincers'' have increased ASPD under shrouded zones.
      And all enemies have increased MSPD.'
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 5957d20fddbef0c4a84deb9a2b697478
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Paint it White
    Description: Even the malice someone held,\nEven the nights of a nameless town,\nEven
      you, shut tightly away in yourself like this,\nI know I'll still remain connected.\nYeah,
      let's paint it white.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 0c0000000e0000000f00000010000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 0500000001000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: Some 'Candles' will be placed beforehand. 'Knight Territory
      Hibernators' need to stay inside shrouded zones for longer to fall asleep,
      and have increased ATK and MSPD upon waking up.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: bf1f81c12ec4f1848a6c9a18f207bff1
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: 24ji
    Description: Passing through today, and before long it is tomorrow.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 020000000c0000000e00000010000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 0500000001000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: Different starting position. 'Candleknights' hold more
      candles.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 98efc80de1d633246ac76bc700274480
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Sleep
    Description: Even so, I still want to talk about the future,\nKeep shining faintly,
      until the day I burn out.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 0
    AppearingEnemies: 0e0000001000000012000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 05000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: '''Candle''''s illumination range is reduced. ''Sentinent
      Toys'' have greatly increased DEF and RES.'
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 572cadc0e31134040b40992b315390ac
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: World Apart
    Description: Close my eyes, I try to escape to a world with you.\nBut even in
      that imaginary world, I, too, lost you, along with my everything.
    AddOn: 
    StageCompleteCondition: 1
    AppearingEnemies: 020000000a0000000c0000000f000000100000001200000013000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 05000000010000000400000000000000
    BanSkills: 
    ChallengeModeModifier: All 'Gloompincers' will be replaced by 'Sentinent Toys'.
    SecretDes: 
  - SceneAssetReferences:
      m_AssetGUID: 15a4bf2fd32fd0a4a9c8b98d6b74e81c
      m_SubObjectName: 
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 1
    Title: Moonlight
    Description: It's just the moon, shining again tonight, as if searching for something
      that has long lost.
    AddOn: '<color=#00FFD0>Mint Fumo: Grants [INVENTIO] ''Geologist - Study'' and
      ''Geologist - Explore'' (ignores mutually exclusive).</color>\n\n<color=yellow>Swap
      cool-down reduces. And your units have greatly increased attributes.</color>'
    StageCompleteCondition: 3
    AppearingEnemies: 010000000a0000000e0000000f0000001200000013000000
    EnvironmentTypes: 05000000030000000100000004000000
    BanSkills: 050000000600000038000000
    ChallengeModeModifier: '''Saint Statue'' additionally grants increased ASPD and
      MSPD to all enemies while present.'
    SecretDes: 
